{"type":"failure","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-05-16T02:28:01.012Z","evidence":{"commit":"a0a9fc7ad7db9eb55a186ab378b18c0eb0163981"},"outcomes":[{"status":"success","agent":"builder-visual-identity"}],"dir_anchors":[".claude/hooks",".claude/skills/shared-flow-authoring",".claude/skills/task-flow-authoring"],"description":"Next.js dev web container bakes the validation package compiled output into the image; runtime mounts only the package src tree, not the compiled tree. When the validation barrel gains new public exports, webpack reads the stale compiled file via main field and reports import errors; the form resolver crashes when zodResolver gets an undefined schema.","resolution":"pnpm stack:up with the rebuild flag rebuilds the web image with the fresh compiled output baked in. The dist auto-mount pattern is api-only by design. The api iterates with stack:reload-api; the web side needs the rebuild flag whenever a sfx package gains new public exports.","id":"mx-0c69bf"}
